y in  and giving very personalized  recommendation and targeted  recommendation for the for the farmer  taking it one step further you know  integrating that intelligence back into  the work management system of the  broader agricultural company to help  deployment of the right resources in the  right way in a smarter way and and as we  do that think about the living you know  adaptive process that I mentioned  earlier you know the the farmer the  agricultural operations manager they  became part of that learning loop and  they received the recommendation they  looked at the recommendation took an  action the feedback was good there they  look back the feedback into the learning  system if the if the if the result was  not that great they also provide that  feedback as a result of that the whole  precision agricultural engine you know  started becoming smarter over grid of  time and then it it scaled from applying  to one  particular farmland to hundreds of those  farm lands you know across different  crop varieties over a period of six  months and that's AI at scale  you know industrialized across their  businesses and really you know  completely changing a mind shift this  company came from a mind shift of in the  past you know they would take more  rule-based experience based decisions  and today it's all happening with data  becoming data native and really living  you know the new adaptive agricultural  process where the farmers and the  agricultural you know machine operators  all of them are part of the new AI  learning system providing feedback on  every interaction every iteration and  what what is it result in it results in  higher yield of the produce better  quality optimization of resources water  resources nutrients human labor and  primarily it's augmenting the human to  actually whether it's the farmer or the  operator agricultural operator to make  better decisions make better profits  serve people like you and me with better  quality of food so that