rking  very closely with Google in in driving  this where we are using basically Google  vision API which is really a powerful  out-of-the-box capability that is  helping us to extract the you know the  natural text that is there in the  invoice picture along with the spatial  information you know of that particular  picture and then bringing that together  concatenating that together to extract  features you know from those  concatenations and we created you know  what we call as basically these are  digitalized tokens you know a word with  a position where it is placed and each  of them we are uniquely identifying as  digitalized tokens and then we are  making multiple vectors you know around  those tokens to help create features  that uniquely define that and then those  features are then used to train the deep  learning models which are then fed back  into the life you know system of all the  invoices that we have to validate that  to check for issues errors if there is  any kind of potential fraud or  compliance issue and flag that to the  humans and then the human associate  doesn't have to do all the grunt work  that was being done earlier but now is  more in an advisory role and is more in  a supervisory role whereas all the you  know grunt work of validating checking  you know an accuracy and all of that is  being checked and then there is a green  light given and if there is a green  light given and the human agent has  approved it it goes on for processing if  there are fraud or compliance related  issues or missing information or some  duplicate information some conflicting  information that's flagged off as well  to the human agent and then the human  agent accordingly takes more supervisory  and advisory kind of you know function  from there and the fact that we are  deploying it on Google technology with  the cloud platform it has really helped  us scale from one client to 200 clients  today you know and the fact that we are  managing 70 million invoi